[statement]
A name is decided before the carried name its one candidate needs only if
that candidate may be chosen for it: `px` provides `x1` at no version and
has no priority, so `x1` is not decided before `dep`, and `w`, which would
be through it, waits its turn after `v`, which goes to `gk`. Contrast
`a-requirer-s-requirers-are-decided-first`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w x1

P:kw
V:1
D:x3
p:v w=1

P:px
V:1
D:dep
p:x3=1 x1

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install dep 1
install px 1
install kw 1
install app 1
